  "description": "JOKGAU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H56 Ho4 N12 O16,4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho1A (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho2A (Ho) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.831-3.841 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.89-114.91°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H72Ho4N12O20.",
